{\pard\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sl\sa0 \plain\f1\fntnamaut Chorus 1\par
\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sl\sa0 \plain\f1\fntnamaut There's a new name\par
\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sl\sa0 \plain\f1\fntnamaut Written down in glory,\par
\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sl\sa0 \plain\f1\fntnamaut And it's mine.\par
\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sl\sa0 \plain\f1\fntnamaut O yes, it's mine!\par
\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sl\sa0 \plain\f1\fntnamaut And the white-robed\par
\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sl\sa0 \plain\f1\fntnamaut Angels sing the story,\par
\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sl\sa0 \plain\f1\fntnamaut "A sinner has come home."\par
\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sl\sa0 \plain\f1\fntnamaut \par
\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sl\sa0 \plain\f1\fntnamaut For there's a new name\par
\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sl\sa0 \plain\f1\fntnamaut Written down in glory,\par
\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sl\sa0 \plain\f1\fntnamaut And it's mine,\par
\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sl\sa0 \plain\f1\fntnamaut O yes it's mine.\par
\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sl\sa0 \plain\f1\fntnamaut With my sins forgiven\par
\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sl\sa0 \plain\f1\fntnamaut I am bound for heaven,\par
\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sl\sa0 \plain\f1\fntnamaut Nevermore to roam. \par
\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sl\sa0 \plain\f1\fntnamaut \par
\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sl\sa0 \plain\f1\fntnamaut Verse 1\par
\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sl\sa0 \plain\f1\fntnamaut I was once a sinner, but I came\par
\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sl\sa0 \plain\f1\fntnamaut Pardon to receive from my Lord.\par
\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sl\sa0 \plain\f1\fntnamaut This was freely given, and I found\par
\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sl\sa0 \plain\f1\fntnamaut That He always kept His word. \par
\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sl\sa0 \plain\f1\fntnamaut \par
\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sl\sa0 \plain\f1\fntnamaut Verse 2\par
\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sl\sa0 \plain\f1\fntnamaut I was humbly kneeling at the Cross,\par
\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sl\sa0 \plain\f1\fntnamaut Fearing naught but God's angry frown,\par
\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sl\sa0 \plain\f1\fntnamaut When the heavens opened and I saw\par
\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sl\sa0 \plain\f1\fntnamaut That my name was written down. \par
\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sl\sa0 \plain\f1\fntnamaut \par
\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sl\sa0 \plain\f1\fntnamaut Verse 3\par
\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sl\sa0 \plain\f1\fntnamaut In the Book 'tis written\par
\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sl\sa0 \plain\f1\fntnamaut "Saved by grace."\par
\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sl\sa0 \plain\f1\fntnamaut O the joy that came to my soul!\par
\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sl\sa0 \plain\f1\fntnamaut Now I am forgiven and I know,\par
\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sl\sa0 \plain\f1\fntnamaut By the blood I am made whole.}
}